{"id":"fc43fd787805e1b8","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-implattice.md","title":"Principal-ideal lattice","display":"df-implattice — Principal-ideal lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-implattice","aliases":["27-df-implattice"],"display":"df-implattice — Principal-ideal lattice","depends_on":["[[27-df-boollattice]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-implattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-implattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implattice — Principal-ideal lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"825f4a87fb2f99c8\" href=\"?note=825f4a87fb2f99c8\" title=\"27-df-boollattice\">27-df-boollattice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，固定本文件各函数、项及关系的元数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}_n\">\\(\\mathcal{B}_n\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"825f4a87fb2f99c8\" href=\"?note=825f4a87fb2f99c8\" title=\"27-df-boollattice\">27-df-boollattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Down}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Down}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid g\\leq f\\},\\qquad\\mathcal{L}_f\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Down}(f),\\;\\{(g,h)\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)^2\\mid g\\leq h\\},\\;\\{((g,h),g\\wedge h)\\mid g,h\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\},\\;\\{((g,h),g\\vee h)\\mid g,h\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\},\\;\\mathbf{0}_n,f\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid g\\leq f\\},\\qquad\\mathcal{L}_f\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Down}(f),\\;\\{(g,h)\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)^2\\mid g\\leq h\\},\\;\\{((g,h),g\\wedge h)\\mid g,h\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\},\\;\\{((g,h),g\\vee h)\\mid g,h\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\},\\;\\mathbf{0}_n,f\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_f\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_f\\)</span> is a finite distributive lattice; restricting to syntactic terms need not preserve joins.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boollattice","status":"resolved","id":"825f4a87fb2f99c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boollattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boollattice","status":"resolved","id":"825f4a87fb2f99c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ and $\\mathcal{B}_n$ (see [[27-df-boollattice]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Down}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid g\\leq f\\},\\qquad\\mathcal{L}_f\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Down}(f),\\;\\{(g,h)\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)^2\\mid g\\leq h\\},\\;\\{((g,h),g\\wedge h)\\mid g,h\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\},\\;\\{((g,h),g\\vee h)\\mid g,h\\in\\mathrm{Down}(f)\\},\\;\\mathbf{0}_n,f\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_f","display":false}],"bytes":1040,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-implattice|df-implattice — Principal-ideal lattice]]"}],"outgoing":["825f4a87fb2f99c8"]}